WEBVTT

00:37:57.492 --> 00:38:00.318
Everybody and their brother
has said exactly the same thing.

00:38:00.342 --> 00:38:01.493
AG: (Chuckles)

00:38:01.517 --> 00:38:04.246
HI: I'm not advising leaders
to not be authentic.

00:38:04.270 --> 00:38:08.996
I'm advising them to maybe
be a little bit more original

00:38:09.020 --> 00:38:12.010
in what they want to convey
to others. (Laughs)

00:38:12.034 --> 00:38:15.613
AG: (Laughs) I think that's great advice.